      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should probably go but honestly i really hate doctors and i'm trying to stay as natural as possible. i've read that medical grade honey is actually super effective at killing bacteria. isn't there some way to just use that and maybe some herbal stuff to avoid the heavy stuff? i just dont want to deal with the side effects of pills if i can avoid it.",
