      "content": "look i get it but i'm just really stressed about the cost and the whole clinic thing right now. if i were to try something else... like, i have some high strength garlic oil and some oregano oil at home. if i mix those into a salve with the honey and apply it thick, wouldn't that be like a natural antibiotic? i just need to know if there is any way to manage this myself for a few days to see if it settles down before i commit to a doctor.",
